!.env.*.example
*.keystore
*.jks
**/android/keystore/
**/android/local.properties
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials*.json
cloudflared*.yml

# Private ops tooling / internal notes (kept out of the public repo)
deploy.py
deploy_mobile.py
tools/ops/
knowledge.md
docs/server.md
docs/playstore-*.md
release/
.claude/

